Falsifies `extensible_host_controller_interface::verification::every_event_decodes_from_the_bits_the_specification_gives`.

The defect: `Event::decode` reads the endpoint id as six bits, so a reserved bit 21 above the five-bit Endpoint ID leaks into the endpoint.

Expected to fail: the harness's check that the endpoint is the five bits at 16 to 20 of dword 3.

diff --git a/src/event.rs b/src/event.rs
--- a/src/event.rs
+++ b/src/event.rs
@@ -64,7 +64,7 @@
                 residual: words[2] & 0x00ff_ffff,
                 code,
                 slot,
-                endpoint: ((words[3] >> 16) & 0x1f) as u8,
+                endpoint: ((words[3] >> 16) & 0x3f) as u8,
             },
             transfer_request_block_type::COMMAND_COMPLETION => Event::Command {
                 transfer_request_block: pointer,
